<title>USA: CCC buys 20,500 T U.S. wheat for Mozambique.</title>
<headline>CCC buys 20,500 T U.S. wheat for Mozambique.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp of the U.S. Department of Agriculture said it bought 20,500 tonnes of U.S. Northern Spring/Dark Northern Spring wheat for export to Mozambique.</p>
<p>The wheat was purchased at $169.32 a tonne, FOB, from Peavey Company out of Paulina, La.</p>
<p>Delivery was slated for March 5-31 delivery, it said.</p>
<p>((Doris Frankel 312-983-7305))</p>
</text>
